{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentSpan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"type","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV","text":"Span"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"type","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"body","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Receives the span; its result is returned.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The span covers every component of the type in storage order, which is not the creation order once components were"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed. It is zero copy: it views the storage itself. Because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~Escapable"},{"type":"text","text":", it cannot leave "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(storing it in a variable outside the closure or returning it is a compile time error), so it can never dangle."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var maxX = 0","nexus.componentSpan(reading: Position.self) { (positions: Span<Position>) in","    for i in positions.indices { maxX = max(maxX, positions[i].x) }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"type":"text","text":": loop over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"indices"},{"type":"text","text":". Element access is bounds checked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" runs the type is locked for reading: structural changes (creating or destroying entities, adding or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removing components, replacing a component with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"set"},{"type":"text","text":") and writes to the type stop the process with a message,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since they would move or change what the span views. Reading the component through the nexus and reading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the type again are fine. Collect changes and apply them after the call."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty storage (or a type no entity ever had) passes an empty span."}]},{"anchor":"Storage","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sparse-set storage keeps all components of a type in one array, so the span always views the storage itself."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The archetype storage keeps one column per table (one table per component set), so entities with different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component sets are not next to each other. If one table holds all components of the type the span views its column,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as above. If several tables hold them, the span views a temporary copy that is made table by table, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one allocation and O(N) copying per call and is released after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":". Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to get zero copy spans, one batch per table."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1) plus ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/componentSpan(reading:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"title":"componentSpan(reading:_:)","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false},{